    "detailed_description": "Syndeo-Complex is a first-person shooter. It is inspired by games like Half-Life and Doom (1993). You will have to explore twisting levels, fight enemies and solve puzzles. At the end of each level, you will have to defeat tougher enemies: the Nekron Kyttaron. This will allow you to progress in the game and unlock the characters' stories.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.poster.avif?t=1747077556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.webm?t=1747077556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.mp4?t=1747077556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Here is the story so far</h2><br>You are Dyo. You were born in the spaceship Prophet 60091.<br>You are an annihilator, a human genetically modified and augmented.<br><br>Your mother, whose identity remains secret, died under mysterious circumstances. She was the founder of the mega corporation Syndeo.<br><br>Your father, Enas, commander of the spaceship Prophet 60091, captured Miden, your loved one. His plans are unknown.<br><br>Your goal is to decimate your father's army and to save Miden.<br>To do this, you must kill all the Nekron Kyttaron and then destroy the Prophet 60091 with the SH10151 orbital gun.<br><br>No one will do it for you.<br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game includes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 mysterious hub that connects all levels<br></li><li>4 levels (5 planned), each with its own environment<br></li><li>3 bosses (5 planned) called Nekron Kyttaron<br></li><li>7 weapons (10 planned) including a pistol, an assault rifle, a missile launcher, a shotgun, etc<br></li><li>16 enemies and characters (19 planned) with their own stories to unlock<br></li><li>3 drugs<br></li><li>12 music tracks (50 minutes), downloadable as free DLC<br></li><li>Philosophical dialogues<br></li><li>Enigmatic storyline</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Syndeo-Complex is a first-person shooter. It is inspired by games like Half-Life and Doom (1993). You will have to explore twisting levels, fight enemies and solve puzzles. At the end of each level, you will have to defeat tougher enemies: the Nekron Kyttaron. This will allow you to progress in the game and unlock the characters' stories.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.poster.avif?t=1747077556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.webm?t=1747077556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988930/extras/feb198c1d57e2902899825070d99c346.mp4?t=1747077556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Here is the story so far</h2><br>You are Dyo. You were born in the spaceship Prophet 60091.<br>You are an annihilator, a human genetically modified and augmented.<br><br>Your mother, whose identity remains secret, died under mysterious circumstances. She was the founder of the mega corporation Syndeo.<br><br>Your father, Enas, commander of the spaceship Prophet 60091, captured Miden, your loved one. His plans are unknown.<br><br>Your goal is to decimate your father's army and to save Miden.<br>To do this, you must kill all the Nekron Kyttaron and then destroy the Prophet 60091 with the SH10151 orbital gun.<br><br>No one will do it for you.<br><br>--<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game includes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 mysterious hub that connects all levels<br></li><li>4 levels (5 planned), each with its own environment<br></li><li>3 bosses (5 planned) called Nekron Kyttaron<br></li><li>7 weapons (10 planned) including a pistol, an assault rifle, a missile launcher, a shotgun, etc<br></li><li>16 enemies and characters (19 planned) with their own stories to unlock<br></li><li>3 drugs<br></li><li>12 music tracks (50 minutes), downloadable as free DLC<br></li><li>Philosophical dialogues<br></li><li>Enigmatic storyline</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Syndeo-Complex you will explore five different environments connected by a hub. Each level has its own mechanics, weapons, enemies and bosses. The Keli, small droids, will (probably) guide you in your quest.",
